      <el-alert type="info" :closable="false" title="仅比较明确声明的完整候选方案；未来数量是受审情景，不是潜在需求，也不执行采购或库存变更。" />
      <p>院内物资 {{ local.item_kind }} · {{ local.item_id }}；声明数量单位 {{ local.original_unit_text??'未知（null）' }}；声明成本单位 {{ local.currency_text??'未知（null）' }} / {{ local.original_cost_unit_text??'未知（null）' }}。</p>
      <p>明确物理范围 hospital_inventory；未来 {{ source.date_from }} 至 {{ source.date_to }}，{{ source.scenario.days.length }} 个业务日；IANA 时区 {{ source.timezone }}。资料截止 {{ source.as_of }}。</p>
      <p v-if="accepted.run">冻结任务状态：{{ taskState(accepted.run.status) }}。</p>
      <p>声明候选 {{ source.candidates.length }} 件，零订单原件 {{ zeroOrderCount }} 件。每件方案整体比较，不重组订单行，也不自动补造零单基线。</p>
      <p>受审规则状态 {{ reviewText(source.scenario.policy.policy_review) }}：效期含当日；日初先移除已失效量，再接收当日到货，依效期和本次公开批次标识顺序分配非冻结量，最后核对共同预算和日末余量约束。这是本次明确审核的软件情景政策。</p>
      <el-button @click="emit('inspect',source.source_id)">核对本次完整库存与候选依据</el-button>
      <template v-if="analysis">
        <p>比较已与服务器冻结的 Prompt 摘要及模型版本对齐；逐日原量、守恒和费用在浏览器独立重算。</p>
        <p>本次核对 {{ analysis.candidate_count }} 件：已核可行 {{ analysis.known_feasible_count }} 件、已核不满足约束 {{ analysis.known_infeasible_count }} 件、未知 {{ analysis.unknown_count }} 件。</p>
        <p>已核可行子集的最低明确采购成本 {{ exact(analysis.best_known_feasible_cost) }}。{{ analysis.best_among_declared_candidates?'完整声明候选集合内的最低成本已核清，全部并列项见下表。':analysis.all_declared_candidates_proven_infeasible?'该集合已核无可行方案，不产生最低可行采购成本。':'尚不能证明整个声明集合的最低成本；未知候选不能按不可行或零成本处理。' }}</p>
        <p v-if="analysis.all_declared_candidates_proven_infeasible">完整声明候选集合内，所有方案均不满足至少一项明确约束；这不代表声明集合外不存在可行方案。</p>
        <p>没有自动选择方案。采购成本只包含明确数量、对应单价和订单／方案固定费，不代表全部经济成本；没有提供运营效果验证。</p>
        <el-table :data="analysis.candidate_results.slice((candidatePage-1)*10,candidatePage*10)" aria-label="完整采购候选比较">
          <el-table-column label="声明候选"><template #default="{row}">{{ candidateLabel(row.candidate_id) }}</template></el-table-column>
          <el-table-column label="整件状态"><template #default="{row}">{{ stateText(row.status) }}</template></el-table-column>
          <el-table-column label="库存轴"><template #default="{row}">{{ stateText(row.inventory_status) }}</template></el-table-column>
          <el-table-column label="成本轴"><template #default="{row}">{{ row.cost_status==='known'?'已核完整成本':'成本未知' }}：{{ exact(row.total_cost) }}</template></el-table-column>
          <el-table-column label="共同预算"><template #default="{row}">{{ budgetText(row.budget_status) }}</template></el-table-column>
          <el-table-column label="已核最低成本子集"><template #default="{row}">{{ analysis.best_known_feasible_candidate_ids.includes(row.candidate_id)?'并列项':'—' }}</template></el-table-column>
          <el-table-column label="逐日证明"><template #default="{row}"><el-button @click="selectedId=row.candidate_id">核对 {{ candidateLabel(row.candidate_id) }}</el-button></template></el-table-column>
        </el-table>
        <el-pagination v-if="analysis.candidate_results.length>10" v-model:current-page="candidatePage" :page-size="10" :total="analysis.candidate_results.length" layout="prev,pager,next,total" />
        <template v-if="selected">
          <h4>{{ candidateLabel(selected.candidate_id) }}</h4>
          <p>完整采购成本 {{ exact(selected.total_cost) }}；已知费用部分和 {{ exact(selected.known_cost_subtotal) }}，部分和不替代未知完整成本。</p>
          <p v-if="selected.reasons.length">明确缺项或冲突：{{ selected.reasons.map(reasonText).join('；') }}。</p>
          <p>完整订货量 {{ exact(selected.totals.ordered) }}，期内收货 {{ exact(selected.totals.received) }}，已满足情景量 {{ exact(selected.totals.fulfilled) }}，未满足情景量 {{ exact(selected.totals.unmet) }}，预计失效移出 {{ exact(selected.totals.expired) }}。</p>
          <p>期末总量 {{ exact(selected.totals.ending_total) }}，可用量 {{ exact(selected.totals.ending_usable) }}，冻结量 {{ exact(selected.totals.ending_frozen) }}；失效移出仅为情景账，不是实际报损或处置记录。</p>
          <el-table v-if="selected.violations.length" :data="selected.violations" aria-label="候选明确约束不满足"><el-table-column label="约束"><template #default="{row}">{{ violationText(row.code) }}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column prop="date" label="日期"/><el-table-column label="原量"><template #default="{row}">{{ exact(row.actual) }}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="限值"><template #default="{row}">{{ exact(row.limit) }}</template></el-table-column></el-table>
          <el-table v-if="selected.daily" :data="selected.daily.slice((dayPage-1)*10,dayPage*10)" aria-label="逐日精确库存守恒">
            <el-table-column prop="date" label="业务日期"/><el-table-column label="期初总量"><template #default="{row}">{{ exact(row.opening_total) }}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="到货"><template #default="{row}">{{ exact(row.arrived) }}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="失效移出"><template #default="{row}">{{ exact(row.expired) }}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="分配"><template #default="{row}">{{ exact(row.allocated) }}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="未满足"><template #default="{row}">{{ exact(row.unmet) }}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="日末总量"><template #default="{row}">{{ exact(row.closing_total) }}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="可用／冻结"><template #default="{row}">{{ exact(row.closing_usable) }} ／ {{ exact(row.closing_frozen) }}</template></el-table-column>
          </el-table>
          <p v-else>原库存、到货、数量或明确政策仍有未知，未补造逐日库存账。已知成本轴可独立核对。</p>
          <el-pagination v-if="selected.daily?.length>10" v-model:current-page="dayPage" :page-size="10" :total="selected.daily.length" layout="prev,pager,next,total" />
        </template>
      </template>
      <p v-else>已核对完整冻结原件；该任务没有已接受的比较结果，不显示最优或可行性结论。</p>
      <el-collapse><el-collapse-item title="查看院内完整原件与公开比较证明"><p>院内原件只在当前获准会话中展开；独立计算服务仅接收受控公开原量和匿名技术标识。</p><el-button @click="showPrivate=!showPrivate">{{ showPrivate?'收起':'展开' }}完整院内原件</el-button><pre v-if="showPrivate" aria-label="完整院内库存原件">{{ JSON.stringify(packet.inventory_scenario.snapshot,null,2) }}</pre><el-button @click="showPublic=!showPublic">{{ showPublic?'收起':'展开' }}公开库存原量</el-button><pre v-if="showPublic" aria-label="公开库存原量">{{ JSON.stringify(source,null,2) }}</pre><el-button v-if="analysis" @click="showProof=!showProof">{{ showProof?'收起':'展开' }}完整逐日证明</el-button><pre v-if="showProof&&analysis" aria-label="完整库存候选证明">{{ JSON.stringify(analysis,null,2) }}</pre></el-collapse-item></el-collapse>
    </template>
  </section>
</template>
<script setup>
import {computed,onActivated,onBeforeUnmount,onDeactivated,ref,shallowRef,watch} from 'vue';
import {useStore} from 'vuex';
import {verifyInventoryContext,verifyInventoryRun,verifyInventoryReceipt,inventoryExactText,inventoryAnalysisVersionSupported} from '@/api/ai/inventoryResults';
import {supportCanonical} from '@/api/inpatientSupport';
const emit=defineEmits(['inspect']);
const props=defineProps({run:{type:Object,default:null},context:{type:Object,default:null},receipt:{type:Object,default:null},expectedItemKind:{type:String,default:null},expectedItemId:{type:Number,default:null},expectedScenarioId:{type:String,default:null},references:{type:Object,default:null},active:{type:Boolean,default:true},auditOnly:{type:Boolean,default:false}}),store=useStore(),accepted=shallowRef(null),checking=ref(false),error=ref(''),selectedId=ref(null),candidatePage=ref(1),dayPage=ref(1),showPrivate=ref(false),showPublic=ref(false),showProof=ref(false);let version=0,alive=true,paused=false;const blocked=new WeakSet();
const roles=computed(()=>Array.isArray(store.getters['user/permissions'])?store.getters['user/permissions']:[]),allowed=computed(()=>props.active&&!!store.state.user.accessToken&&roles.value.some(r=>['admin','director','pharmacist','super_admin'].includes(r))),auth=()=>supportCanonical([props.active,props.auditOnly,props.expectedItemKind,props.expectedItemId,props.expectedScenarioId,props.references,store.state.user.accessToken,store.state.user.username,roles.value]),packet=computed(()=>accepted.value?.run?.inventory_findings||accepted.value?.run?.frozen_request?.payload?.context||accepted.value?.context),source=computed(()=>packet.value?.inventory_source),analysis=computed(()=>accepted.value?.run?.result?.inventory_analysis||null),selected=computed(()=>analysis.value?.candidate_results.find(c=>c.candidate_id===selectedId.value)||analysis.value?.candidate_results[0]||null),local=computed(()=>{const s=packet.value?.inventory_scenario.snapshot;return s?{item_kind:s.item_kind,item_id:s.item_id,original_unit_text:s.collection.unit_definitions.find(r=>r.source.source_record_id===s.request.unit_definition_id)?.source.payload.original_unit_text,currency_text:s.request.cost_unit.currency_text,original_cost_unit_text:s.request.cost_unit.original_cost_unit_text}:{};}),zeroOrderCount=computed(()=>source.value?.candidates.filter(c=>c.orders.length===0).length||0),exact=inventoryExactText;
const taskState=v=>({queued:'排队中',running:'计算中',succeeded:'已接受',failed:'执行失败',cancelled:'已取消接收'})[v]||'未知',stateText=v=>({feasible:'已核满足声明约束',infeasible:'已核不满足声明约束',unknown:'未知'})[v]||'未知',reviewText=v=>({confirmed:'明确核实',not_confirmed:'未确认',unknown:'未知'})[v]||'未知',budgetText=v=>({satisfied:'已核满足',violated:'已核超限',unknown:'未知',not_applicable:'明确不适用'})[v]||'未知',candidateLabel=id=>{const index=source.value?.candidates.findIndex(c=>c.candidate_id===id);return `候选 ${index>=0?index+1:'?'} · ${id.slice(0,8)}`;};
const reasons={opening_not_independently_observed:'期初库存未经独立实盘',professional_review_not_confirmed:'专业确认未核清',scope_not_confirmed:'实际范围未核清',coverage_incomplete:'原量覆盖不完整',coverage_unknown:'原量覆盖未知',unknown_quantity:'原数量未知',quantity_unit_unknown:'数量单位未核清',quantity_unit_mismatch:'数量单位不符',cost_unit_unknown:'成本单位未核清',cost_unit_mismatch:'成本单位不符',initial_total_conflict:'期初总量与原账或分批原量不一致',frozen_exceeds_quantity:'冻结量超过该批总量',legacy_reconciliation_unknown:'旧库存账核对未确认',legacy_batch_applicability_unknown:'真实批次适用性未知',legacy_quantity_unknown:'旧账数量未知',invalid_original_inventory_quantity:'原库存数量无效',physical_reconciliation_unknown:'实盘总量与分批核对未确认',unknown_frozen_quantity:'冻结量未知',frozen_review_not_confirmed:'冻结状态未核清',unknown_expiry:'效期未知',expiry_review_not_confirmed:'效期审核未核清',unknown_arrival:'到货日期未知',unknown_cost:'完整成本未知',price_basis_not_confirmed:'单价计量依据未核清',candidate_incomplete:'整件候选覆盖不完整',candidate_set_not_confirmed:'完整候选集合未核清',opening_carry_forward_not_confirmed:'期初实盘延续至计划日未核清',other_changes_not_confirmed:'无其他库存变化的声明未核清',frozen_continuation_not_confirmed:'冻结量延续未核清',policy_not_confirmed:'日事件与分配政策未核清',unknown_constraint:'明确约束仍有未知'};
const reasonText=v=>reasons[v]||v,violationText=v=>({unmet_scenario_quantity:'未满足受审日数量',minimum_usable_not_met:'日末可用量低于明确下限',maximum_total_exceeded:'日末总量超过明确上限',budget_exceeded:'完整采购成本超过共同预算'})[v]||v;
function reset(){version++;accepted.value=null;checking.value=false;error.value='';selectedId.value=null;candidatePage.value=dayPage.value=1;showPrivate.value=showPublic.value=showProof.value=false;}
function invalidate(){for(const value of [props.run,props.context])if(value&&typeof value==='object')blocked.add(value);reset();}
async function verify(){reset();const ticket=version,key=auth(),current=()=>alive&&!paused&&allowed.value&&ticket===version&&key===auth();if(!current()||!props.run&&!props.context)return;if(blocked.has(props.run||props.context)){error.value='会话或页面已变化，请重新读取完整受审库存场景和任务';return;}checking.value=true;try{if(!!props.run===!!props.context)throw new Error('须分别核对一件完整任务或资料预览');const value=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(props.run?{run:props.run}:{context:props.context})),expected={itemKind:props.expectedItemKind,itemId:props.expectedItemId,scenarioId:props.expectedScenarioId,references:props.references},options={current,auditOnly:props.auditOnly&&roles.value.includes('super_admin')};if(props.receipt&&(!value.run||!verifyInventoryReceipt(props.receipt,value.run)))throw new Error('任务回执与完整结果标识或上下文不同');if(value.run?.result?.inventory_analysis&&!inventoryAnalysisVersionSupported(value.run.result.inventory_analysis))throw new Error('原运行版本当前无法重算，不能将旧原数作为当前比较结果展示；原冻结件保留供超级管理员技术审计');const valid=value.run?await verifyInventoryRun(value.run,expected,options):await verifyInventoryContext(value.context,expected,options);if(!current())return;if(!valid)throw new Error('库存完整原件、单位、声明候选或精确比较证明无法核对，暂不展示');accepted.value=value;}catch(failure){if(current())error.value=failure.message||'完整库存证明无法核对';}finally{if(ticket===version)checking.value=false;}}
watch(()=>supportCanonical([store.state.user.accessToken,store.state.user.username,roles.value]),invalidate,{flush:'sync'});watch(()=>props.active,v=>{if(!v)invalidate();},{flush:'sync'});watch([()=>props.run,()=>props.context,()=>props.receipt,auth],verify,{deep:true,immediate:true,flush:'sync'});watch(selectedId,()=>{dayPage.value=1;});onDeactivated(()=>{paused=true;invalidate();});onActivated(()=>{if(paused){paused=false;verify();}});onBeforeUnmount(()=>{alive=false;reset();});
</script>
<style scoped>p{line-height:1.7}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;max-height:500px;overflow:auto}.el-button{margin:6px 8px 6px 0}.el-table,.el-alert{margin:12px 0}</style>
